# SwiftPM build output. Never committed: it is machine-specific, ~230 files, and a
# committed binary invites reviewing the artefact instead of the source. The build is
# reproducible with `swift build -c release`, and the binary's identity is recorded in
# docs/computer-ops/70-HELPER-SIGNING.md (path, size, sha256, signature state).
.build/
dist/
